{"id":"input-be02777010e0","steamAppId":"1449200","name":"AI: THE SOMNIUM FILES - nirvanA Initiative","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449200/library_600x900.jpg","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1449200/","genres":["Adventure"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"full","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":20.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"20 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","sourceProfile":{"shortDescription":"Special Agents Mizuki and Ryuki, along with their AI partners Aiba and Tama, are tasked to solve the bizarre Half Body serial killings in this sequel to the critically acclaimed AI: THE SOMNIUM FILES.","developers":["Spike Chunsoft Co., Ltd."]},"content":{"status":"success","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:04:17.543848+00:00","identityStatus":"verified","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","shortDescription":"Special Agents Mizuki and Ryuki, along with their AI partners Aiba and Tama, are tasked to solve the bizarre Half Body serial killings in this sequel to the critically acclaimed AI: THE SOMNIUM FILES.","detailedDescription":"Six years ago, the right half of a corpse was discovered. The left half was never found…until six years later, completely fresh with no signs of decay. Now, Special Agents Mizuki and Ryuki, along with their AI partners Aiba and Tama, are tasked to solve the bizarre Half Body serial killings while unveiling the mysterious plot known only as the Nirvana Initiative…"},"vi":{"status":"translated","shortDescription":"Đặc vụ Mizuki và Ryuki, cùng với các cộng sự của họ là Aiba và Tama, được giao nhiệm vụ giải quyết những vụ giết hại hàng loạt kỳ lạ của nửa cơ thể trong phần tiếp theo này cho AI được ca ngợi:","detailedDescription":"6 năm trước, nửa xác chết đã được tìm thấy.  Phân nửa bên trái chưa bao giờ được tìm thấy... cho đến